{
  "schema_version": 1,
  "locale": "zh-CN",
  "scenario_id": "5_01_016_22",
  "source_raw_hash": "sha256:b5bb69b79ec1f6a2ae651fe64adaeb364ba9a1ae9035c545c2db112638838a7d",
  "entries": {
    "story-text:v1:5_01_016_22:5_01_016_22_a:cmd-000012:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:093f6b4d8dc5a11edc7cef50bfd771dba4d08105650af476c721b2bdcf1adb56",
      "text": "是情人节巧克力吗。 谢谢你，●●●●プロデューサー。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:5_01_016_22:5_01_016_22_a:cmd-000019:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:79bcc017275b0387ed3f73bdc4e074708113c84195ef65be4dde077d2e458090",
      "text": "没想到能收到家人以外的人送的巧克力， 让我有些惊讶呢。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:5_01_016_22:5_01_016_22_a:cmd-000025:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:e1639a9fe79d5a56c04dd0b84287889ae3ef570d5417a39d28bf934ad7f6e514",
      "text": "巧克力是具有恢复疲劳功效的食物。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:5_01_016_22:5_01_016_22_a:cmd-000029:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:40fea4d34f0952785847be9f3bfd97899ccb4cbc369ccb12422181f6e20d58f4",
      "text": "我今天有训练的安排。 就等结束之后再享用吧。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:5_01_016_22:5_01_016_22_a:cmd-000035:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:3940d09086d0adc564c0a98bfe587bd293068261df0a4b990ed085092c328c81",
      "text": "谢谢你，●●●●プロデューサー。 那么，我出发了！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:5_01_016_22:5_01_016_22_b:cmd-000014:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:d4d1b889d7c2871f186af652cb71fe7772020ee41fd9bd5a2e53c0fa494f8f80",
      "text": "你给我准备了情人节巧克力吗。 谢谢你，●●●●プロデューサー。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:5_01_016_22:5_01_016_22_b:cmd-000028:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:88a58f5d512bc5e5bd8eae1641bb93d9a70a75bb79a98fa2953e3c1d5c3babab",
      "text": "看起来很好吃。 虽然现在是正式上场前，我可以先吃一颗吗？",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:5_01_016_22:5_01_016_22_b:cmd-000030:choice_short:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:76b4a8d6d8f2fa82bbf210633bfd380e899cfe0ecb92a6f45a5ab75744ce72b6",
      "text": "当然请便！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:5_01_016_22:5_01_016_22_b:cmd-000031:choice_short:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:b930fc9d0ac1408815c23cb1366c9f4d6a0a8a8750b2f2e2667ae927acadab2b",
      "text": "好的！请尝尝看吧！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:5_01_016_22:5_01_016_22_b:cmd-000040:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:f2c748a072c7d93385aea076f6a0fc91d5c5e0f0ad07e4f9d11816bb5d5f78ee",
      "text": "那我就不客气了。 ……嗯，非常好吃！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:5_01_016_22:5_01_016_22_b:cmd-000055:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:384ad9392091999860e26e526bc6ff33ceb8501b1797e82d15a8b093958b5e9c",
      "text": "这个是……原来如此。 是特意迎合了我的口味啊。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:5_01_016_22:5_01_016_22_b:cmd-000062:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:588d46229ab6248818b155d3c41ae97680cf3b949ef65d36179b04ae94445a23",
      "text": "真好吃。 一旦开始吃就有点停不下来了。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:5_01_016_22:5_01_016_22_b:cmd-000072:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:fc20c776a25e6ee90e55d598be4d475fe1c3cac60f1114cd7f991383db675d8b",
      "text": "制作人，感谢你在百忙之中 还为我准备了巧克力。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:5_01_016_22:5_01_016_22_b:cmd-000078:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:fbc02a0366abc280374c0abd1d7dbbdd08579a913f3d1d377b20b79f6d56a1ea",
      "text": "多亏了你，我现在干劲十足。 感觉能发挥出最棒的表现。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:5_01_016_22:5_01_016_22_b:cmd-000084:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:f06b2d582c4e7033c6e29f67fe4cb9cd1e9ffae6f5ed39a1b10444d2bc87d29c",
      "text": "巧克力的效果，你就好好看着吧！",
      "status": "draft"
    }
  }
}
